SUMMARY:Shabbat Morning Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Join Elisa Spungen Bildner for a Shabbat morning yoga practice at 9 am on April 25\, 2026. As our theme for our practice\, we’ll focus on the Mussar (Jewish ethical study) subject of lovingkindness or “chesed” in Hebrew–given the strife in the world\, I thought it would be an opportune moment to think about this trait. \nTruly–all levels welcome–please bring a mat. Looking forward to practicing with you!
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/shabbat-morning-yoga-2/
LOCATION:NJ
CATEGORIES:Worship
END:VEVENT
