SUMMARY:
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Temple Ner Tamid on Tuesday\, April 28th\, at 7:30 pm for a fascinating discussion with Congresswoman Lamonica McIver (NJ-1o) in conversation with CBS News’s Jim Axelrod. The Conversation will cover topics that include the current war with Iran\, immigration policy\, the rise of antisemitism\, the economy and an update on Washington. \nThe event is free and open to the public. \nThis program will be available for streaming on the TNT YouTube channel. There is no need to register if you plan to live stream. \nThe Temple Talks Series at Temple Ner Tamid is hosted by Rabbi Marc Katz and moderated by a nationally known journalist. The objective of the series is to engage our audience with discussions by current leaders on current issues that impact all communities. \nClick Here to Register!
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/1955/
LOCATION:NJ
CATEGORIES:General
END:VEVENT
